{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"dbda485bc484f7a6","__entryId":"style-wabisabi","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-wabisabi-scene\"><div class=\"wb-scene-head\"><b>一 席 茶 事</b><span>五月 · 雨水</span><i>第 04 则</i></div><div class=\"wb-scene-body\"><aside>午后<br>雨停<br>器温<br>微凉</aside><main><small>今日所用 / 粗陶茶碗</small><h3>先闻香，<br>再等水开。</h3><p>雨停后泡一壶焙火乌龙。先让杯壁暖一暖手，再把第一口留给安静。</p><div><span>焙火乌龙 · 3 泡</span><b>续写此刻 →</b></div></main><figure><i></i><span>手捏<br>茶碗</span></figure></div><em class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\">茶</em></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.05) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:5px 5px;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">素 然</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;letter-spacing:2px\">家具 · 织物 · 器物 · 关于</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:30px;padding:34px 34px 30px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:8px\">生活,素之然也</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:22px;letter-spacing:6px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">棉麻四件套</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2.1;margin:14px 0 18px\">未漂染的棉,亚麻的骨。<br>洗过三次,才到最好的时候。</p>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#33322e;border-bottom:1px solid #33322e;padding-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:2px\">查看细节 →</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">价格以实际页面为准</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:110px;height:110px;flex:none;background:#e9e4d8;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #ddd6c6\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">织物</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:22px 30px 18px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">一 间 茶 事</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">春 · 器物上新</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">粗陶茶杯 · 一只一窑</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">库存以实际页面为准</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">价格待补充</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">白瓷公道杯</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">现货</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">价格待补充</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">竹制茶则 · 老竹</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">现货</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">价格待补充</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">每件附作者手写卡片</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">茶</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:24px 28px;position:relative\">\n      <div style=\"height:74px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#dfe3d8,#c9cfc0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;letter-spacing:3px\">山间 · 晨雾</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">雾 见 温 泉</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2;margin:10px 0 16px\">海拔八百米,只有八间房。<br>泉水引自山腹,四季恒温。</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2;font-size:12px;color:#5b564c\">\n        <span>7.26 入住</span><span>7.28 离店</span><span style=\"color:#a8a294\">2 位</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577\">价格与房态以实际页面为准</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f5f2ea;background:#2e2d29;padding:7px 18px;letter-spacing:3px\">预订</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:26px 34px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:14px\">散文 · 秋日备忘录</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">柿 子 熟 了</div>\n      <div style=\"width:34px;height:1px;background:#a8a294;margin:18px 0\"></div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px\">院里的柿子树是搬来那年种下的。头三年只长叶,第四年忽然挂了果,青转橙,橙转红,谁也不催它。</p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:14px\">邻人路过,说该摘了。我说再等等,等霜打过,甜味才肯沉下来。</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:22px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">甲辰年 · 霜降</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">记</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div class=\"style-wabisabi-scene\"><div class=\"wb-scene-head\"><b>A tea affair</b><span>May · Rain</span><i>No. 04</i></div><div class=\"wb-scene-body\"><aside>Afternoon<br>The rain stopped<br>Temperature<br>Slightly cool</aside><main><small>Today’s use / Stoneware tea bowl</small><h3>Smell the aroma first,<br>and then wait for the water to boil. </h3><p>After the rain, brew a pot of roasted oolong. Let the bowl warm your hands, then sit quietly with the first sip. </p><div><span>Roasted Oolong · 3 brews</span><b>Write on from here →</b></div></main><figure><i></i><span>Hand-pinched<br>tea bowl</span></figure></div><em class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\">Tea</em></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.05) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:5px 5px;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">Su Ran</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;letter-spacing:2px\">Furniture · Fabrics · Utensils · About</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:30px;padding:34px 34px 30px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:8px\">Life is natural</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:22px;letter-spacing:6px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">Washed cotton-and-linen bedding set</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2.1;margin:14px 0 18px\">Undyed cotton with a linen weave. <br>It softens beautifully after a few washes. </p>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#33322e;border-bottom:1px solid #33322e;padding-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:2px\">View details →</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">See the live page for the current price</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:110px;height:110px;flex:none;background:#e9e4d8;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #ddd6c6\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Fabric</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:22px 30px 18px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">A tea room</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Spring · New utensils</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">Hand-thrown stoneware teacup · One of a kind</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">See the live page for current availability</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">Price on request</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">White porcelain serving pitcher</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">In stock</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">Price on request</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">Aged-bamboo tea scoop</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">In stock</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">Price on request</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Each piece comes with a handwritten maker’s note</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">Tea</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:24px 28px;position:relative\">\n      <div style=\"height:74px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#dfe3d8,#c9cfc0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;letter-spacing:3px\">Mountains · Morning fog</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">Kirimi Hot Spring</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2;margin:10px 0 16px\">Eight hundred meters above sea level, with only eight rooms. <br>The spring water is drawn from the heart of the mountain and has a constant temperature all year round. </p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2;font-size:12px;color:#5b564c\">\n        <span>7.26 Check-in</span><span>7.28 Check-out</span><span style=\"color:#a8a294\">2 guests</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577\">Check the live page for current pricing and room availability</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f5f2ea;background:#2e2d29;padding:7px 18px;letter-spacing:3px\">Book now</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:26px 34px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:14px\">Essay · Autumn Memo</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">Persimmons are ripe</div>\n      <div style=\"width:34px;height:1px;background:#a8a294;margin:18px 0\"></div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px\">The persimmon trees in the yard were planted the year we moved here. In the first three years, it only grew leaves. In the fourth year, it suddenly started to bear fruit, turning from green to orange and then from orange to red. No one bothered it. </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:14px\">A neighbor passed by and said it was time to pick. I said to wait a little longer, until the first frost had sweetened them further. </p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:22px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Jiachen Year·Frost Descent</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">note</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"paper\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.1) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:4px 4px;color:#8a8577\">米白纸底</span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"ink\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:4px\"><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#a8a294\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#5b564c\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#2e2d29\"></i></span></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"serif\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:3px\">衬线</span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"ma\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:2px;background:#2e2d29\"></span></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"asym\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea;position:relative\"><i style=\"position:absolute;top:6px;left:8px;width:12px;height:2px;background:#2e2d29\"></i><i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;right:8px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#b8452f;border-radius:1px\"></i></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"seal\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;font-size:12px\">侘</span></span></span>\n    </span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat\">\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"paper\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.1) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:4px 4px;color:#8a8577\">Off-white paper base</span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"ink\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;gap:4px\"><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#a8a294\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#5b564c\"></i><i style=\"width:13px;height:13px;background:#2e2d29\"></i></span></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"serif\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:3px\">serif</span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"ma\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea\"><span style=\"width:12px;height:2px;background:#2e2d29\"></span></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"asym\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\" style=\"background:#f5f2ea;position:relative\"><i style=\"position:absolute;top:6px;left:8px;width:12px;height:2px;background:#2e2d29\"></i><i style=\"position:absolute;bottom:6px;right:8px;width:8px;height:8px;background:#b8452f;border-radius:1px\"></i></span></span><span class=\"style-wabisabi-anat-plus\">+</span>\n      <span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"seal\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-sw\"><span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;font-size:12px\">wa</span></span></span>\n    </span>","parts":[{"key":"paper","cn":"纸感底色","en":"Paper Base","desc":"示例用带细颗粒的米白色，需检查纹理不会干扰文字","desc_en":"An off-white, subtly textured surface can add warmth, provided it never interferes with legibility."},{"key":"ink","cn":"自然色层级","en":"Earth & Ink","desc":"从产品、摄影和品牌中提取颜色，同时为正文与状态保留足够对比","desc_en":"Draw colors from the product, photography, and brand while maintaining contrast for text and status."},{"key":"serif","cn":"衬线排版","en":"Serif","desc":"衬线字体和字距可增强阅读节奏，中文正文须以清晰易读为先","desc_en":"Serif typography and measured letter spacing can set a calm reading rhythm; Chinese text must remain clear and legible."},{"key":"ma","cn":"间 · 留白","en":"Ma","desc":"用空白控制节奏和关系，具体比例由内容和屏幕决定","desc_en":"Use space to pace the composition and clarify relationships; let content and screen size determine the proportions."},{"key":"asym","cn":"不对称平衡","en":"Asymmetry","desc":"用内容、留白和对齐关系建立平衡，不强制特定位置","desc_en":"Create asymmetrical balance through content, alignment, and open space rather than forcing perfect symmetry."},{"key":"seal","cn":"朱红点缀","en":"Accent","desc":"高饱和点缀可以承担落款或关键强调，但不要求全页只能使用一次","desc_en":"Use saturated accents sparingly for a signature detail or key emphasis, not as a page-wide requirement."}]},"use":[{"t":"家居和器物品牌，突出材料与手工过程","m":"style-wabisabi-use-home"},{"t":"茶、香和手作商品，内容节奏较慢","m":"style-wabisabi-use-tea"},{"t":"旅宿页面，呈现空间、材料与停留感","m":"style-wabisabi-use-hotel"},{"t":"散文和个人博客，重视长文阅读体验","m":"style-wabisabi-use-blog"}],"dont":[{"t":"数据密集工具为了氛围牺牲扫描效率","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-data","bad":true},{"t":"高饱和颜色没有明确职责，破坏安静层级","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-bright","bad":true},{"t":"只有大面积空白，却缺少排版和材质细节","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-cheap","bad":true},{"t":"促销标签过多，打断整体阅读节奏","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-crowd","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"从真实材料和摄影中提取自然、低刺激的色板","m":"style-wabisabi-color"},{"t":"用留白放慢阅读节奏，但具体比例由内容决定","m":"style-wabisabi-ma"},{"t":"字体选择服务于内容，中英文分别检查字距与可读性","m":"style-wabisabi-serif"},{"t":"通过轻微不对称建立平衡，不让布局失去重心","m":"style-wabisabi-asym"},{"t":"纸张、陶土等肌理只作辅助，不能干扰正文","m":"style-wabisabi-texture"}],"prompt":"做一个手作茶器品牌的内容页，记录器物、泡茶过程和作者笔记。让材料、照片和留白带出安静节奏，同时保持正文、价格和下一步操作易读。材料、照片、价格和文字只用现有资料，缺少的先标“待补充”，不要自行编造。","prompt_en":"Wabi-sabi tea journal, warm paper texture, gray-brown ink, asymmetric whitespace, delicate serif type, hand-formed ceramic material, slow-reading paragraphs, brewing log and continue-writing action, one restrained vermilion seal","scenes":["茶事仪式日志","家居品牌官网","茶器物电商页","温泉旅馆预订页","散文博客文章页"],"en":{"prompt":"Wabi-sabi tea journal, warm paper texture, gray-brown ink, asymmetric whitespace, delicate serif type, hand-formed ceramic material, slow-reading paragraphs, brewing log and continue-writing action, one restrained vermilion seal","use":[{"t":"Home and craft brand","m":"style-wabisabi-use-home"},{"t":"Tea, fragrance, and hand-made goods","m":"style-wabisabi-use-tea"},{"t":"Hospitality and travel site","m":"style-wabisabi-use-hotel"},{"t":"Essay or personal blog focused on long reading","m":"style-wabisabi-use-blog"}],"dont":[{"t":"Reduce scan efficiency in a data-heavy tool","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-data","bad":true},{"t":"Add saturated accents with no clear role","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-bright","bad":true},{"t":"Use large empty areas without careful type and material detail","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-cheap","bad":true},{"t":"Interrupt the quiet rhythm with constant promotion labels","m":"style-wabisabi-dont-crowd","bad":true}],"principles":[{"t":"Build a low-stimulation palette from real materials and imagery","m":"style-wabisabi-color"},{"t":"Use space to slow the reading pace without losing structure","m":"style-wabisabi-ma"},{"t":"Choose type for the language and content","m":"style-wabisabi-serif"},{"t":"Create balanced asymmetry rather than random placement","m":"style-wabisabi-asym"},{"t":"Keep paper, clay, and grain textures behind the reading layer","m":"style-wabisabi-texture"}],"scenes":["Home goods","Craft product","Hospitality","Long-form journal","Slow travel"],"sceneUI":["<div class=\"style-wabisabi-scene\"><div class=\"wb-scene-head\"><b>A tea affair</b><span>May · Rain</span><i>No. 04</i></div><div class=\"wb-scene-body\"><aside>Afternoon<br>The rain stopped<br>Temperature<br>Slightly cool</aside><main><small>Today’s use / Stoneware tea bowl</small><h3>Smell the aroma first,<br>and then wait for the water to boil. </h3><p>After the rain, brew a pot of roasted oolong. Let the bowl warm your hands, then sit quietly with the first sip. </p><div><span>Roasted Oolong · 3 brews</span><b>Write on from here →</b></div></main><figure><i></i><span>Hand-pinched<br>tea bowl</span></figure></div><em class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\">Tea</em></div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;background-image:radial-gradient(rgba(122,112,90,.05) 1px,transparent 1.2px);background-size:5px 5px;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">Su Ran</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;letter-spacing:2px\">Furniture · Fabrics · Utensils · About</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:30px;padding:34px 34px 30px;align-items:center\">\n        <div style=\"writing-mode:vertical-rl;font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:8px\">Life is natural</div>\n        <div style=\"flex:1\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:22px;letter-spacing:6px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">Washed cotton-and-linen bedding set</div>\n          <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2.1;margin:14px 0 18px\">Undyed cotton with a linen weave. <br>It softens beautifully after a few washes. </p>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px\">\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#33322e;border-bottom:1px solid #33322e;padding-bottom:3px;letter-spacing:2px\">View details →</span>\n            <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">See the live page for the current price</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:110px;height:110px;flex:none;background:#e9e4d8;border-radius:2px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px #ddd6c6\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Fabric</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:22px 30px 18px\">\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">A tea room</b>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Spring · New utensils</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">Hand-thrown stoneware teacup · One of a kind</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">See the live page for current availability</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">Price on request</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">White porcelain serving pitcher</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">In stock</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">Price on request</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e;flex:1;letter-spacing:2px\">Aged-bamboo tea scoop</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294\">In stock</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#33322e\">Price on request</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Each piece comes with a handwritten maker’s note</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">Tea</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:440px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:24px 28px;position:relative\">\n      <div style=\"height:74px;border-radius:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#dfe3d8,#c9cfc0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:18px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;letter-spacing:3px\">Mountains · Morning fog</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:17px;letter-spacing:4px;color:#2e2d29\">Kirimi Hot Spring</div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7d786a;line-height:2;margin:10px 0 16px\">Eight hundred meters above sea level, with only eight rooms. <br>The spring water is drawn from the heart of the mountain and has a constant temperature all year round. </p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid #e3ded2;border-bottom:1px solid #e3ded2;font-size:12px;color:#5b564c\">\n        <span>7.26 Check-in</span><span>7.28 Check-out</span><span style=\"color:#a8a294\">2 guests</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:16px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8577\">Check the live page for current pricing and room availability</span>\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#f5f2ea;background:#2e2d29;padding:7px 18px;letter-spacing:3px\">Book now</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>","<div style=\"max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:#f5f2ea;font-family:'Songti SC','Noto Serif SC',serif;padding:26px 34px\">\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:3px;margin-bottom:14px\">Essay · Autumn Memo</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:20px;letter-spacing:5px;color:#2e2d29;font-weight:500\">Persimmons are ripe</div>\n      <div style=\"width:34px;height:1px;background:#a8a294;margin:18px 0\"></div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px\">The persimmon trees in the yard were planted the year we moved here. In the first three years, it only grew leaves. In the fourth year, it suddenly started to bear fruit, turning from green to orange and then from orange to red. No one bothered it. </p>\n      <p style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b564c;line-height:2.3;letter-spacing:1px;margin-top:14px\">A neighbor passed by and said it was time to pick. I said to wait a little longer, until the first frost had sweetened them further. </p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:22px\">\n        <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#a8a294;letter-spacing:2px\">Jiachen Year·Frost Descent</span>\n        <span class=\"style-wabisabi-seal\" style=\"width:24px;height:24px;font-size:12px\">note</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>"]},"usageMocks":{"style-wabisabi-use-home":"<div style=\"width:100%;background:#f5f2ea;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC',serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:2px\">素色床品 · 棉麻四件套</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;margin-top:4px\">家居品牌官网可使用克制的材料与排版</span></div>","style-wabisabi-use-tea":"<div style=\"width:100%;background:#f5f2ea;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px\"><span style=\"display:block;font-family:'Songti SC',serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29;letter-spacing:2px\">手作粗陶茶杯 · 一只一窑</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:#8a8577;margin-top:4px\">茶 / 香 / 器物电商</span></div>","style-wabisabi-use-hotel":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:'Songti SC',serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29\">山里的温泉旅馆 · 房态以实际页面为准</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">民宿预订页可用安静的视觉节奏呈现空间</span></div>","style-wabisabi-use-blog":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-family:'Songti SC',serif;font-size:12px;color:#2e2d29\">「秋日备忘录」· 散文集</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">个人博客与长文阅读</span></div>","style-wabisabi-dont-data":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">数据大盘：多张图表 + 实时刷新 KPI</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">任务密集场景应优先保证扫描效率</span></div>","style-wabisabi-dont-bright":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;background:#f5f2ea;border:1px solid #ddd\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">+</span><span style=\"width:44px;height:26px;background:#ff2a6d\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">高饱和色需要明确职责，避免打断安静层级</span>","style-wabisabi-dont-cheap":"<div style=\"width:100%;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">只有一行字 + 纯白底,没有内容关系</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--red);margin-top:4px\">留白应帮助阅读或展示材料，而不是替代信息</span></div>","style-wabisabi-dont-crowd":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span class=\"mk-tag red\">限时 5 折</span><span class=\"mk-tag orange\">爆款</span><span class=\"mk-tag blue\">新品</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">促销标签过多会打断阅读节奏</span></div>"}}}